     "expected": {"matches": false},
     "upstream_ref": "pkg/apis/rbac/helpers_test.go:TestResourceMatches[\"doesn't fail on empty\"] L129"},
    {"name": "lone slash rule entry matches nothing here", "provenance": "upstream_test",
