     "expected": {"matches": false},
     "upstream_ref": "pkg/apis/rbac/v1/evaluation_helpers.go:ResourceMatches L59, L69-71"},
    {"name": "exact multi-slash rule matches the same combined string", "provenance": "upstream_code",
